OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start in the east but
OL,6,Fsoon turning cloudy from the west with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain arriving from early
OL,8,Fmorning, these heavy and perhaps
OL,9,Fthundery. Turning brighter later,
OL,10,Fsqually rain is likely to across the
OL,11,Fsouth of the region.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSqually rain and showers will
OL,14,Fcontinue to clear to the east this
OL,15,Fevening, with most areas becoming dry
OL,16,Fovernight with clear spells developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
